  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Where The Sidewalk Ends<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Come dip your toes into the refreshing ocean waters when you book a stress-free getaway to this custom-construction Inlet Beach home. Offering access to a shared tropical pool, ocean views, and a location that puts you in the heart of the action, your vacation promises to be filled with seaside fun!<br><br><br><br>Located less than a block from the beach and a short walk to shopping and restaurants in downtown Rosemary Beach, this lovely home puts everything you need for a hassle-free stay within easy reach. Shopping, dining, and soft sands all await you!<br><br><br><br>Featuring conveniences like a private washer/dryer, central A/C, and free WiFi, you'll have all the comforts of home at your fingertips. Do a few laps in the shared pool before whipping up a delicious dish in the fully equipped kitchen. Break out the provided board games, or let the kids play while the adults enjoy a nightcap on the balcony and plan the next group adventure. An outdoor living area and gulf-view rooftop balcony provide nice ways to enjoy the fresh air. Traveling with young children? A convenient daybed space that can be closed off with barn doors is just off the main suite.<br><br><br><br>Treat yourself and the whole crew to a memorable stay when you book your next trip to this private and quiet Inlet Beach home.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Seaside home w/ WiFi, ocean views, shared pool, & plenty of room"
        }
