      {
        "author": "Kyle B.",
        "date": "2023-06-01T15:16:55Z",
        "id": "6478b667097b067d7a2ef373",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We were attending a wedding in Rosemary Beach and this house was absolutely perfect. We were a 5 minute walk from the beach and a 10 minute walk to the wedding venue. It was convenient and spacious enough to fit the 6 total people on the trip. Thanks for a great first experience on VRBO!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
